est results covering every serving-stack image in scope, with no gaps.\n55\t- The package passes the required security review board milestone reviews.\n56\t- The package is submitted to the accredited certification lab and accepted\n57\t  into its review queue.\n58\t\n59\t## Risks / Notes\n60\t\n61\t- The accredited lab's historical turnaround is six to nine months, and the\n62\t  review board meets on a fixed cadence; both are externally controlled and\n63\t  cannot be compressed by engineering effort. They gate the certification\n64\t  outcome and the certification date, not this epic's deliverable (a complete,\n65\t  submitted package).\n66\t- Re-split trigger: if module-inventory and test-result assembly outgrows\n67\t  roughly one sprint of effort, split the assembly work from the\n68\t  submission/review-board coordination work.\n69\t\n70\t## HLR Traceability\n71\t\n72\t- HLR-2 (P0): a compliance evidence package (module inventory, build\n73\t  attestations, test results) is assembled and submitted through the security\n74\t  review board to the external certification lab.\n75\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"chatcmpl-tool-a6a1e664ade4a266","agent_id":"a948b50ea61e70aac","session_id":"349a626c-8ce8-443f-b6d9-a34677df2f24","uuid":"0084be55-1153-404e-b0b5-c90f4e1fad6d","timestamp":"2026-10-23T19:41:21.848Z","tool_result_meta":[{"id":"chatcmpl-tool-9394d367bbfbb7e5","permission_decision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reason_type":"mode"}}],"subagent_type":"general-purpose","task_description":"Review RHAISTRAT-9013 decomposition"}
