ated on a known-bad\n54\t  sample).\n55\t- The check passes on the remediated serving-stack images.\n56\t- The check is gating for all serving-stack builds in the pipeline — a failure\n57\t  blocks the build rather than only reporting.\n58\t\n59\t## HLR Traceability\n60\t\n61\t- HLR-3 (P1): CI enforces FIPS regressions — a gating check fails any\n62\t  serving-stack build that reintroduces non-validated crypto usage.\n63\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"chatcmpl-tool-a6a1e664ade4a266","agent_id":"a948b50ea61e70aac","session_id":"349a626c-8ce8-443f-b6d9-a34677df2f24","uuid":"73810f36-86e2-40f4-a0e1-b9519df286c3","timestamp":"2026-10-23T19:41:22.492Z","tool_result_meta":[{"id":"chatcmpl-tool-bcfd79da6ecedba4","permission_decision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reason_type":"mode"}}],"subagent_type":"general-purpose","task_description":"Review RHAISTRAT-9013 decomposition"}
