uling and review-board cadence are\n45\texternally controlled and cannot be compressed by engineering effort.\n46\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"chatcmpl-tool-bdb3cb3103d03576","agent_id":"aeaef9707407d607e","session_id":"349a626c-8ce8-443f-b6d9-a34677df2f24","uuid":"4229123d-55e4-4295-833c-b783a15cc366","timestamp":"2026-10-23T19:44:38.403Z","tool_result_meta":[{"id":"chatcmpl-tool-be0da5cf0e56af54","permission_decision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reason_type":"mode"}}],"subagent_type":"general-purpose","task_description":"Revise RHAISTRAT-9013 decomposition"}
